Needs codex-vm -board-mmio, which the default harness does not pass. The RP2040's SIO block sits at 0xD0000000, above the RAM ceiling; since 2026-07-13 the guest page tables map the device gigabyte and codex-vm can back that window with -board-mmio, and this test then passes (24). Run it from build/boards-test.ps1, which is where the nine board batteries live.
